
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BANK-MATH.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 BALANCE-AMT    PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 10000.00.
01 AMOUNT         PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 2000.00.
01 RESULT-AMT     PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0.
01 DISPLAY-AMT    PIC Z(6)9.99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    DISPLAY "INITIAL BALANCE: " BALANCE-AMT

    ADD AMOUNT TO BALANCE-AMT
    MOVE BALANCE-AMT TO DISPLAY-AMT
    DISPLAY "AFTER DEPOSIT: " DISPLAY-AMT

    MOVE 3000.00 TO AMOUNT
    SUBTRACT AMOUNT FROM BALANCE-AMT
    MOVE BALANCE-AMT TO DISPLAY-AMT
    DISPLAY "AFTER WITHDRAWAL: " DISPLAY-AMT

    MULTIPLY BALANCE-AMT BY 2 GIVING RESULT-AMT
    MOVE RESULT-AMT TO DISPLAY-AMT
    DISPLAY "AFTER MULTIPLICATION: " DISPLAY-AMT

    DIVIDE BALANCE-AMT BY 2 GIVING RESULT-AMT
    MOVE RESULT-AMT TO DISPLAY-AMT
    DISPLAY "AFTER DIVISION: " DISPLAY-AMT

    COMPUTE RESULT-AMT = BALANCE-AMT * 0.05
    MOVE RESULT-AMT TO DISPLAY-AMT
    DISPLAY "FIVE PERCENT INTEREST: " DISPLAY-AMT

    STOP RUN.
